Package: soulmatch
Title: SoulMatch Dating App MVP
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("SoulMatch", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "team@example.invalid")
Description: A modular Shiny dating prototype with versioned questionnaires,
